                <pb facs="0530" n="522" sameAs="frus:frus1938v02/pg522"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6831/192: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">MacVeagh</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-04-01T13:00:00+02:00">April 1, 1938—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received April 1—9:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>21. Department’s instruction No. 445, March 8th. I handed note to Prime Minister
                    this morning emphasizing Department’s desire for a prompt reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacVeagh</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
